  data:  # 11e1
    kind: work_item  # 11e1
    title: "play-routes is the sole AnalysisRun carrying non-canonical version='1' (deprecated fake-version artifact); 83/84 carry '5.0.1'"  # 11e1
    status: todo_hard  # 11e1
    priority: 2  # 11e1
    parent:  # 11e1
    tags:  # 11e1
    - dogfood  # 11e1
    - dogfood_tranche_07  # 11e1
    isbefore: []  # 11e1
    duplicate_of: []  # 11e1
    not_duplicate_of: []  # 11e1
    pr_ref:  # 11e1
    description: "**Mechanism.** Across 84 ARs, version is '5.0.1' on 83 but '1' on exactly one — the play-routes pass. play_routes.py:44 hardcodes PASS_VERSION = '1' and passes it to AnalysisRun.create(version=PASS_VERSION) at :188. It is the ONLY producer that hardcodes PASS_VERSION away from the canonical PASS_VERSION: str = __version__ convention (grep confirms). Contract violations: ir.py:53-55 ('All analyzers and linkers use this' canonical pass version); spec line 234/278 (version e.g. 'hypergumbo-0.1.0', package-shaped); ir.py:110-114 (the legacy -v1 suffix is 'a fake-versioning artifact' — play-routes' literal version='1' IS that artifact); spec line 270 (run_signature hashes version) so the wrong version feeds play-routes' run_signature (sha256:05b10c7f9567c49f), computed against a different basis than all 83 others.\n\n**Consequence.** A consumer keying L2 reproducibility on run_signature gets a play-routes signature that will NOT change when the package version bumps (since '1' is frozen), unlike every other pass.\n\n**Evidence.** Fresh hypergumbo run on /tmp Play routes.conf emits 60 ARs at 5.0.1 and exactly 1 (play-routes) at version='1'. (Note: a prior item INV-kimut covering this is DELETED — operator should be aware; this re-files the still-live mechanism.)\n\n**Related (distinct).** Distinct from WI-mipul (pass_version=None/empty on 14 override-analyze ARs incl play-routes — a SEPARATE field) and WI-mifok (pass_version absence). play-routes is a singleton outlier on the version field VALUE. Source: dogfood_tranche_07 F124.A1, fresh-run reproduced."  # 11e1
    fields: {}  # 11e1
