  message: "Re-surfaced in dogfooding tranche 10 (U17, F185.A1, severity 3). AnalysisRun.version='1' on play-routes vs '5.0.1' on 83 others, from hardcoded PASS_VERSION='1' at play_routes.py:44 — exactly this item. Fix: use canonical PASS_VERSION = __version__ in play_routes.py:44. (related WI-riroz: AR.version='1' corrupts run_signature.)"  # 814e
